#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:4 2a8ebb3a42e747f5ba81fc0923ac4a8e
msgid "Every figure below is produced by running this library — no mock-up, no hand-drawn curve. The pipeline is:"
msgstr "下面每一张图都是**运行本库**得到的——没有手绘、没有示意图。流程是："

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:7 c3994aec80714f2eb5a5ec5b8d3fe181
msgid ":code:`docs/demos/sil_export.cpp` drives the SIL bench through one scenario and writes a trace and a metrics CSV;"
msgstr ":code:`docs/demos/sil_export.cpp` 驱动 SIL 台架跑一个场景，写出轨迹与指标 CSV；"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:9 03ec48e12ba34a7ea67b9d07616a40c7
msgid ":code:`docs/demos/make_figures.py` compiles it against the repository sources, runs it, and plots the result;"
msgstr ":code:`docs/demos/make_figures.py` 把它对着仓库源码编译、运行，并把结果画成图；"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:11 ed15c149737c4f89b8404417d90129da
msgid ":code:`python docs/build.py` copies the figures into the site."
msgstr ":code:`python docs/build.py` 把图复制进站点。"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:18 e30d44adadfa4f84a8d1b4572168d88c
msgid "The scenarios mirror the SIL acceptance suite (S1–S3), so what you see here is the same closed loop the test suite asserts on."
msgstr "这些场景与 SIL 验收用例（S1–S3）一一对应，所以你看到的就是测试断言的那条闭环。"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:28 a31ca4782554458ba7637e79dbfbbebb
msgid "These traces come from the **C++** path with the SIL plant. The C API — and therefore the Python module — runs on the stub HAL, whose current feedback is a fixed script, so it cannot produce a closed loop on its own."
msgstr "这些曲线来自 **C++** 路径 + SIL plant。C API——以及因此的 Python 模块——跑在桩 HAL 上，电流反馈是固定脚本，自己构不成闭环。"
